q .1 0 0 .1 0 0 cm/R7 gs /R9 CS .871094 .847656 .890625 SCN 10 w 510.234 340.156 m 5442.52 340.156 l S q 10 0 0 10 0 0 cm /R9 cs .466553 .439209 .486328 scn BT/R11 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 51.0234 21.2598 Tm[-61097.6(3)]TJ ET Q q 10 0 0 10 0 0 cm /R9 cs .172607 .141113 .199951 scn BT/R15 24 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0234 766.536 Tm (Why Local Music Organizer exists)Tj ET Q q 10 0 0 10 0 0 cm /R9 cs .250977 .227539 .274414 scn BT/R11 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0234 742.336 Tm (Local Music Organizer was not invented as a generic software product. It began as a personal solution)Tj 14.2 TL T* (written by a music collector and Music.app user with a very large offline library accumulated over many)Tj T* (years.)Tj 20.2 TL T* (The collection eventually became difficult to control: duplicate records, repeated playlist entries, missing)Tj 14.2 TL T* (artwork, inconsistent tags, broken file references, multiple versions of albums, rare releases and formats)Tj T* (spread across folders and disks. Manual checking was too slow, and separate utilities showed only)Tj T* (fragments of the problem.)Tj -.08279 Tw 20.2 TL T* (The creator needed one place to answer practical questions before changing anything: Which file is better?)Tj 0 Tw 14.2 TL T* (Where is this track used? Is this a duplicate record or a second physical file? What is missing? What can)Tj T* (be cleaned without losing the original?)Tj 20.2 TL T* (Conversion created the same frustration. No single converter handled every difficult source in the)Tj 14.2 TL T* (collection. TAK, SACD ISO, DSD, DTS, AC3, CUE albums, tracker modules and other archival formats)Tj T* (could require several tools and a fragile sequence of actions.)Tj 20.2 TL T* (Local Music Organizer brought order back to that real collection and solved problems that had)Tj 14.2 TL T* (accumulated for years. Only after it worked as a personal tool did the creator decide it might be useful to)Tj T* (other people who also maintain serious offline music libraries.)Tj ET Q /R9 cs .9375 .898438 .980469 scn .789063 .658203 .921875 SCN 7 w 480.234 4553.36 4992.29 480 re B* q 10 0 0 10 0 0 cm .243164 .156982 .341064 scn BT/R15 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0234 483.336 Tm (The result is intentionally cautious: understand first, review second, act only when the user)Tj 15 TL T* (explicitly chooses to act.)Tj ET Q Q

